---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 5, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Disclosure"
	description="VehicleGearUp's disclosure covering affiliate links, product reviews, sponsored content, and external links."
	icon="💰"
>
	<p class="updated" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

	<p>
		At <strong>VehicleGearUp</strong>, transparency and honesty are the cornerstones of our relationship with our customers. We believe it is important for you to understand how our website operates, how we earn revenue, and how we provide recommendations for products and services.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
	<div class="note-box">
		<span class="note-icon">💵</span>
		<span>
			Some of the links on VehicleGearUp are affiliate links. This means that if you click on a link and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission <strong>at no additional cost to you</strong>.
		</span>
	</div>
	<p>
		Our affiliate relationships help support the operation of the website and allow us to continue providing high-quality content, guides, and product recommendations.
	</p>
	<p>
		We only recommend products and services that we trust and believe will provide value to our readers. Our opinions are always independent, and commissions do not influence our evaluations or reviews.
	</p>

	<h2>Product reviews &amp; recommendations</h2>
	<p>
		VehicleGearUp provides in-depth product reviews, guides, and comparisons across a wide range of <strong>vehicles and parts</strong>, including:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>ATV, UTV, and off-road parts</li>
		<li>Batteries and electrical components</li>
		<li>Interior upgrades and accessories</li>
		<li>Electric vehicle (EV) accessories</li>
		<li>Tires and wheels</li>
		<li>Performance upgrades</li>
		<li>Trailer and towing solutions</li>
		<li>Motorcycle and truck parts</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		All product information is based on research, manufacturer specifications, and firsthand experience where possible. We aim to give you accurate, honest, and useful insights so you can make informed purchasing decisions.
	</p>

	<h2>Sponsorships &amp; partnerships</h2>
	<p>
		VehicleGearUp may occasionally feature sponsored content or paid promotions. When this occurs, it will always be clearly disclosed. Our commitment is to ensure that sponsored content does not compromise the quality or reliability of the information we provide.
	</p>

	<h2>External links</h2>
	<p>
		Our website may contain links to external websites, including partner retailers and manufacturers. VehicleGearUp is not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of these external sites. We encourage you to read their terms and policies before making any purchases or sharing personal information. See also our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Transparency &amp; trust</h2>
	<p>
		We value your trust above all else. All content, reviews, and recommendations on VehicleGearUp are created with the intention of helping you <strong>make better decisions about vehicle parts and accessories</strong>. We never promote products solely for profit, and our goal is to provide value to our audience first.
	</p>
	<div class="note-box warm">
		<span class="note-icon">🤝</span>
		<span>
			By using our website, you acknowledge and agree to this disclosure. VehicleGearUp is committed to full transparency and will update this page as needed to reflect changes in our practices or partnerships.
		</span>
	</div>
</StaticPage>
